VisTouch 2 s micro-clip materialization
=======================================
Source: 312 released physical segments (dataset/{audio,tactile,video}/*)
Window: 0.50 s
Stride: 0.15 s (0.35 s / 70% overlap)
Stored duration: 2.00 s
Stretch factor: 4.0x

Every audio/tactile/video triplet is first cut at the same source epoch
pair, then stretched through the same linear temporal mapping:
  - video:   60 interpolated frames at 30 fps
  - audio:   32,000 interpolated waveform samples at 16 kHz
  - tactile: 200 interpolated force values at 100 Hz

